      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <button type="submit"
          class="px-6 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-500 to-red-500 hover:from-orange-600 hover:to-red-600 text-white font-semibold transition-all shadow-md">
          🔑 Reset Password Sekarang
